AltoRewardsDistributor::setLockBonusDiscount
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new lock bonus discount is greater than MAX_DISCOUNT
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when new lock bonus discount is valid
        ├── when setting a normal discount value
        │   ├── it should update lock bonus discount
        │   └── it should emit SetLockBonusDiscount event
        ├── when setting zero discount
        │   ├── it should update lock bonus discount
        │   └── it should emit SetLockBonusDiscount event
        ├── when setting maximum discount
        │   ├── it should update lock bonus discount
        │   └── it should emit SetLockBonusDiscount event
        └── when updating discount multiple times
            ├── it should update lock bonus discount for each call
            └── it should emit SetLockBonusDiscount event for each call
